## Windows Configuration Template
# Lichess Bot Account Configuration
# Generate your bot token at: https://lichess.org
# Ensure you check ONLY the "bot:play" scope.

LICHESS_TOKEN=lip_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# Default installer path. If you downloaded from stockfishchess.org manually, 
# change this to your exact file location (e.g., C:\Users\YourName\Documents\stockfish.exe)
STOCKFISH_PATH=C:\Program Files\Stockfish\stockfish.exe
